{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/dcfb6c7a11c7cd7358fc21c08910ce84.poster.avif?t=1767263888\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/dcfb6c7a11c7cd7358fc21c08910ce84.webm?t=1767263888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/dcfb6c7a11c7cd7358fc21c08910ce84.mp4?t=1767263888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot and comedy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lonely game developer. Finding yourself in a fantasy world threatened by the <strong>Singularity Dragon</strong>, you have the opportunity to <strong>summon a harem of catgirls</strong>! The problem is that you first need to assemble this harem and make friends with each of the candidates...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/686ea7b21b35e98b1d20e01fc024c00c.webp?t=1767263888\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel with your squad</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>12 cute catgirls</strong>, each of which has its own unique fighting skills and nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the &quot;<strong><i>Summon Harem</i></strong>&quot; ability to immediately teleport up to 4 selected <strong>catgirls</strong> from your harem to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create <strong>buildings</strong> and <strong>synergy</strong> of your harem to more effectively explore a dangerous and colorful world inhabited by fairy-tale creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your charisma and courage to pave the way to sensitive hearts and together save the world from destruction!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/0d17ae1b0f5fe328aa76ce717d895265.webp?t=1767263888\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/ad0069bb385681abe1e70399a22d756d.poster.avif?t=1767263888\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/ad0069bb385681abe1e70399a22d756d.webm?t=1767263888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/ad0069bb385681abe1e70399a22d756d.mp4?t=1767263888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/3307601e7dfd592f361d8590a314095f.poster.avif?t=1767263888\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/3307601e7dfd592f361d8590a314095f.webm?t=1767263888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/3307601e7dfd592f361d8590a314095f.mp4?t=1767263888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cool gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locations are full of <strong>activities</strong>and <strong>secrets</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting <strong>boss battles</strong> where you are not alone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny dialogues</strong> with answer options are combined with a <strong>deep plot</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have many <strong>abilities</strong> and the ability to improve them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and hardcore achievements!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The drinking mage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740020/2cd2698ad94ab25f976cebc3a8937b6f1700d7da.jpg"},{"name":"Pew...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740020/683e69dfe6d953a81a61a4ae862b40abcd678521.jpg"},{"name":"VolT is now on the team!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740020/a9245ecdf6ba5c1358d544bd5022faeb95122c86.jpg"},{"name":"I received power that my father never dreamed of!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740020/56ddc886e89bdb079001bdf4b97409f6754d6a17.jpg"},{"name":"So... The world is saved?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740020/9fcc81eee1bdbd48745ef877768296c0c31b4271.jpg"},{"name":"Well, well...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740020/8ecd5a74d3a403fb95a4d7d23da32117e341fdb1.jpg"},{"name":"Critical Healer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740020/717e3a058c346a70cf135084c0aaad0c8ba32675.jpg"},{"name":"Heroic passage!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740020/41bba8feaf4d19143a182e5da774ccf03261fef3.jpg"},{"name":"Yoohoo! New record!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740020/ce8826225ee75df68ddb6813f3fb90cf4e0f6697.jpg"},{"name":"Memories in ice...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740020/05d50916dac37bba3fe71d53449b6771a5434fc9.jpg"}],"total":39},"background":"https://store.akamai.stea